SUMMARY:PETER LIU
LOCATION:Mic Drop Comedy Chandler\, 51 E. Boston St.\, Chandler
DESCRIPTION:Peter Liu is a NYC based stand-up comedian and former engineer 
 who has performed at The Wilbur\, The Gramercy\, and Don’t Tell Comedy.\n
 \nRaised between China\, Australia\, New Zealand\, New Jersey\, and New Eng
 land\, Peter brings a unique perspective to family\, culture\, dating\, and
  life in America. A former engineer and lifelong martial artist\, his comed
 y combines sharp observations with personal stories and a healthy disregard
  for good judgment. So\, If you like your comedy\, smart\, personal\, and a
  little unhinged\, Peter’s your guy.\n\nPeter has been featured on Amazon
  Prime\, The San Francisco SketchFest\, the New York Comedy Festival and ha
 s opened for Ronny Chieng\, Joe Wong\, and Jason Leong. With more than 100\
 ,000 followers across social media and 1 million + views on YouTube\, Peter
  is a rapidly growing comedian and you can catch him touring at clubs and t
 heaters across the country.\n\nAges 17+\n\nFee applies if transferring conf
 irmed ticket purchase to another guest.\n\nDoors for open for seating appro
 ximately 30 minutes before late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject 
 to prior show endtime and may change without notice\, beyond our control.\n
 \nNo refunds or exchanges.\n\nTicket resale is strictly prohibited. Any tic
 kets purchased or listed on a third-party resale website or platform is a d
 irect violation of our Venue Policies and will not be honored\, resulting i
 n denied admission. Third party resale websites and platforms include but a
 re not limited to StubHub\, Vivid Seats\, Seat Geek\, eTickets\, Event Tick
 ets Center\, GoTickets\, Craigslist\, OfferUp\, Facebook Marketplace\, etc.
 \n\nWaitlists are available for sold out shows. To join the Waitlist\, you 
 must be present at the venue prior to showtime on the day of the event. You
  will need to provide your name and how many tickets you'd like to purchase
 . About 10-15 minutes after the show starts\, we will go through our showro
 om and find the empty seats available and sell tickets in order of arrival.
